WEBVTT

00:09:29.636 --> 00:09:31.996
The world that I live in --
how did it come to be?

00:09:31.996 --> 00:09:35.596
And more importantly: Where to from here?

00:09:36.796 --> 00:09:38.876
You may not like what you discover.

00:09:39.676 --> 00:09:43.596
But sit with it, feel the discomfort.

00:09:44.356 --> 00:09:47.316
Colonization has stolen from us

00:09:47.356 --> 00:09:50.396
one of the greatest treasures
we can obtain:

00:09:50.436 --> 00:09:51.596
each other.

00:09:52.276 --> 00:09:57.916
This year alone, we've witnessed
pathological political and social unrest.

00:09:58.716 --> 00:10:02.436
That is why healing
is the antidote humanity needs